# AlHaitham Xingqiu Lauma Ineffa. ~21s Rot. KQMS KurtC. AlHaitham Hyperbloom with Lunar Support. Only token Lunarcharge, Ineffa sticks to FoPL. Xingqiu uses skill between Alhaitham's mirror refresh.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
alhaitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
alhaitham add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
